<!doctype html>
<html lang="tr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><title>Oracle DDL Migration Raporu | İnnova</title>
<style type="text/css">@media only screen and (max-width:640px){.mail-shell{width:100%!important;max-width:100%!important}.pad{padding-left:18px!important;padding-right:18px!important}.metric{display:inline-block!important;width:32%!important;box-sizing:border-box!important;border-bottom:1px solid #DFE5EB!important}.header-tagline{display:none!important}.data-table td,.data-table th{padding:7px 5px!important;font-size:10px!important;word-break:break-word!important}.hero-title{font-size:27px!important;line-height:34px!important}.narrow-hide{display:none!important}}</style></head>
<body style="margin:0!important;padding:0!important;background:#EBF0F4;color:#253142;font-family:Aptos,Calibri,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#EBF0F4" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;background:#EBF0F4"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="820" align="center"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" class="mail-shell" width="820" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 auto;width:100%;max-width:820px;background:#FFFFFF">
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:27px 34px 18px"><table role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td valign="middle"><table role="presentation"><tr><td><img src="{{ logo }}" width="156" height="30" alt="İnnova" style="border:0;display:block;width:156px;height:30px"></td><td style="padding-left:18px"><div style="border-left:2px solid #D8DFE7;padding-left:15px;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#788599">Daha akıllı<br>Daha güçlü yarınlara</div></td></tr></table></td><td class="header-tagline" align="right" style="font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#8590A0">İnsan için teknoloji.<br>Daha iyi bir gelecek.</td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:7px 34px 22px"><h1 class="hero-title" style="font-size:34px;line-height:42px;font-weight:700;color:#111B2D;margin:0 0 5px;letter-spacing:-.4px">Oracle DDL Migration Raporu</h1><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:22px;margin:0;color:#68778B;font-weight:600">Tek kaynak → Çoklu hedef · DDL önerileri</p><p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#253142">Karşılaştırma süresi: <strong>{{ view.comparison_duration_label }}</strong>{% if view.report_duration_label %}<br><span style="font-size:12px;color:#68778B">Rapor yenileme süresi: {{ view.report_duration_label }}</span>{% endif %}</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:0 34px 25px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%"><tr><td class="metric" width="20%" valign="top" bgcolor="#F3F6F8" style="width:20%;padding:14px 9px;border-right:1px solid #DFE5EB;background:#F3F6F8"><div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:29px;color:#111B2D">{{ view.metrics[0].value }}</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#77869A;line-height:17px">Hedef Ortam</div></td><td class="metric" width="20%" valign="top" bgcolor="#F3F6F8" style="width:20%;padding:14px 9px;border-right:1px solid #DFE5EB;background:#F3F6F8"><div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:29px;color:#111B2D">{{ view.metrics[1].value }}</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#77869A;line-height:17px">Bulunan fark</div></td><td class="metric" width="20%" valign="top" bgcolor="#F3F6F8" style="width:20%;padding:14px 9px;border-right:1px solid #DFE5EB;background:#F3F6F8"><div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:29px;color:#111B2D">{{ view.metrics[2].value }}</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#77869A;line-height:17px">Üretilen DDL</div></td><td class="metric" width="20%" valign="top" bgcolor="#F3F6F8" style="width:20%;padding:14px 9px;border-right:1px solid #DFE5EB;background:#F3F6F8"><div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:29px;color:#111B2D">{{ view.metrics[3].value }}</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#77869A;line-height:17px">İnceleme</div></td><td class="metric" width="20%" valign="top" bgcolor="#F3F6F8" style="width:20%;padding:14px 9px;border-right:1px solid #DFE5EB;background:#F3F6F8"><div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:29px;color:#111B2D">{{ view.metrics[4].value }}</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#77869A;line-height:17px">Üretilemeyen DDL</div></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:0 34px 24px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 12px"><tr><td width="5" bgcolor="#CF1838" style="width:5px;background:#CF1838;font-size:1px">&nbsp;</td><td style="padding-left:16px"><h2 style="margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:28px;color:#131E30;font-weight:700">Genel Özet</h2></td></tr></table><div style="background:#F3F6F8;padding:18px 21px;color:#46566B;font-size:14px;line-height:23px">{{ view.metrics[0].value }} hedef · Bulunan fark: {{ view.metrics[1].value }} · {{ view.metrics[2].value }} DDL işlemi üretildi.
{{ view.metrics[3].value }} işlem inceleme gerektiriyor, {{ view.metrics[4].value }} işlem için DDL üretilemedi.
{% if view.difference_note %}<br>{{ view.difference_note }}{% endif %}
<br><span style="color:#68778B">Üretildi · Veritabanına uygulanmadı. Source ve target salt okunur.</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:0 34px 25px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 12px"><tr><td width="5" bgcolor="#CF1838" style="width:5px;background:#CF1838;font-size:1px">&nbsp;</td><td style="padding-left:16px"><h2 style="margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:28px;color:#131E30;font-weight:700">Hedef Ortam Özeti</h2></td></tr></table><table role="table" class="data-table" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border:1px solid #DCE4EB;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;table-layout:fixed"><thead><tr><th align="left" style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DFE8;background:#EDF1F5;font-size:12px;color:#26354A;text-align:left">Hedef</th><th align="left" style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DFE8;background:#EDF1F5;font-size:12px;color:#26354A;text-align:left">Bulunan fark</th><th align="left" style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DFE8;background:#EDF1F5;font-size:12px;color:#26354A;text-align:left">DDL</th><th align="left" style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DFE8;background:#EDF1F5;font-size:12px;color:#26354A;text-align:left">İnceleme</th><th align="left" style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DFE8;background:#EDF1F5;font-size:12px;color:#26354A;text-align:left">Üretilemeyen DDL</th><th align="left" style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DFE8;background:#EDF1F5;font-size:12px;color:#26354A;text-align:left">Durum</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for t in view.critical_targets %}<tr><td style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E9EE;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#3C4F67;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><strong data-target-id="{{ t.id }}">{{ t.name }}</strong><br>{{ t.schemas|join(', ') }}</td><td style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E9EE;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#3C4F67;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{ t.confirmed_difference_count|count_tr if t.confirmed_difference_count is not none else 'Sonuç alınamadı' }}</td><td style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E9EE;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#3C4F67;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{ t.counts.ready_operations|count_tr if t.counts else 'Bilinmiyor' }}</td><td style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E9EE;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#3C4F67;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{ t.counts.review_operations|count_tr if t.counts else 'Bilinmiyor' }}</td><td style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E9EE;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#3C4F67;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{ t.counts.blocked_operations|count_tr if t.counts else 'Bilinmiyor' }}</td><td style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E9EE;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#3C4F67;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{ t.display_status }}<div style="font-size:11px;line-height:16px;color:#68778B;margin-top:4px">{{ t.status_reason }}</div></td></tr>{% else %}<tr><td colspan="6" style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E9EE;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#3C4F67;overflow-wrap:anywhere">Hedef sonucu bulunmuyor.</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table><p style="color:#7A889B;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;margin:8px 0 0">Çok sayıda hedef bulunduğunda e-postada en yüksek öncelikli 5 hedef gösterilir. Tam liste artifact paketindedir.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:0 34px 24px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 12px"><tr><td width="5" bgcolor="#CF1838" style="width:5px;background:#CF1838;font-size:1px">&nbsp;</td><td style="padding-left:16px"><h2 style="margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:28px;color:#131E30;font-weight:700">Değişiklik Detayları</h2></td></tr></table><p style="font-size:12px;color:#68778B;margin:0 0 10px">Önem sırasına göre en fazla 5 benzersiz nesne. Aynı nesnenin birden fazla hedefteki farkları tek satırda özetlenir.</p><table role="table" class="data-table" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border:1px solid #DCE4EB;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;table-layout:fixed"><thead><tr><th width="60%" align="left" style="width:60%;padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DFE8;background:#EDF1F5;font-size:12px;color:#26354A;text-align:left">Nesne / Fark</th><th width="12%" align="left" style="width:12%;padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DFE8;background:#EDF1F5;font-size:12px;color:#26354A;text-align:left">Hedef</th><th width="12%" align="left" style="width:12%;padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DFE8;background:#EDF1F5;font-size:12px;color:#26354A;text-align:left">İşlem</th><th width="16%" align="left" style="width:16%;padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DFE8;background:#EDF1F5;font-size:12px;color:#26354A;text-align:left">Sonuç</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for o in view.important_objects %}<tr><td style="padding:10px 10px 4px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:0;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#3C4F67;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><strong>{{ o.object_label }}</strong><br>{{ o.type_label }}</td><td style="padding:10px 10px 4px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:0;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#3C4F67;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{ o.target_label }}</td><td style="padding:10px 10px 4px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:0;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#3C4F67;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{ o.kinds|join(', ') }}</td><td style="padding:10px 10px 4px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:0;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#3C4F67;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{ o.display_status }}</td></tr><tr class="reason-row"><td colspan="4" style="padding:0 10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E9EE;font-size:11px;line-height:17px;color:#68778B;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{ o.reason }}</td></tr>{% else %}<tr><td colspan="4" style="padding:10px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E9EE;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#3C4F67;overflow-wrap:anywhere">Raporlanacak nesne yok.</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table><div style="margin-top:10px;background:#F3F6F8;color:#46566B;padding:12px 16px;font-size:12px;line-height:19px">{{ view.unique_objects|count_tr }} benzersiz nesneden {{ view.important_objects|length|count_tr }} nesne gösterildi. Tüm nesneler ve tam SQL'ler, ilgili hedefin <strong>Genel DDL</strong> veya <strong>Nesne Bazlı DDL</strong> bağlantısından indirilebilir.</div></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:0 34px 25px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 12px"><tr><td width="5" bgcolor="#CF1838" style="width:5px;background:#CF1838;font-size:1px">&nbsp;</td><td style="padding-left:16px"><h2 style="margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:28px;color:#131E30;font-weight:700">Kaynak ve İzlenebilirlik</h2></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#F3F6F8" style="background:#F3F6F8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:16px;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:#48576D;border-right:1px solid #DEE5EC"><strong style="color:#27364A">Kaynak SHA:</strong> <span style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-all">{{ view.run.source_commit }}</span><br><strong style="color:#27364A">Run:</strong> <span style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-all">{{ view.run.run_id }}</span><br><strong style="color:#27364A">Karşılaştırma:</strong> 1 source → {{ view.metrics[0].value }} target</td><td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:16px;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:#48576D"><strong style="color:#27364A">Çalışma:</strong> {{ view.run.get('build_number') if view.run.get('build_number') is not none else 'Yerel' }}<br><strong style="color:#27364A">Sonuç:</strong> SQL üretildi, uygulanmadı<br><strong style="color:#27364A">Karşılaştırma süresi:</strong> {{ view.comparison_duration_label }}<br><strong style="color:#27364A">Karşılaştırma bitişi (TSİ):</strong> {{ view.comparison_finished_label }}</td></tr></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td style="padding:17px 0 0">{% if view.link %}<a href="{{ view.link }}" style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#BF1533;text-decoration:underline">Tüm DDL Dosyaları ve Ayrıntılı Raporlar →</a>{% endif %}<p style="font-size:11px;line-height:17px;color:#788599;margin:6px 0 0">{{ view.link_note }}</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="border-top:1px solid #E3E8ED;padding:18px 34px 23px"><table role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td style="font-size:11px;color:#7E8B9B">Güvenilir teknoloji, sürdürülebilir yarınlar.</td><td align="right" style="font-size:11px;color:#6F7C8B">Oracle DB Migration Generator · <strong>SQL uygulanmadı</strong></td></tr></table></td></tr>
</table><!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></td></tr></table></body></html>